WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
<v Raghuram G.>Good morning everyone. Let's start the Sprint 14 review. I'll go first — the SupportingDocuments module is complete and PR is up on ADO.

2
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:22.000
<v Sarah PM>Great work Raghuram. Can you also document the Power Automate flow decision in the ADO wiki by end of day today?

3
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.000
<v Raghuram G.>Sure, I'll get that done today.

4
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:40.000
<v Sneha K.>I need to flag a blocker. I'm waiting on the entity schema sign-off from the client for the Hearing Management plugin. It's been 3 days and I can't proceed without it.

5
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:52.000
<v Sarah PM>That's a serious blocker. I'll escalate it to the client director today. Sneha, can you document what exactly you need from them so I can include it in the escalation?

6
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.000
<v Sneha K.>Yes I'll send you that by noon.

7
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:15.000
<v Arjun M.>I have an update on the frontend work. The quarterly tax reporting UI is 70% done. I need Raghuram to review my JavaScript module before I can finish the Select Report navigation.

8
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:25.000
<v Raghuram G.>I can review that tomorrow morning, Arjun. Share the PR link in the channel.

9
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:30.000
<v Arjun M.>Will do.

10
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:45.000
<v Priya R.>Test coverage for the portal deployment workflow is at 80%. I should hit 100% by the end of sprint. No blockers on my side.

11
00:01:46.000 --> 00:02:00.000
<v Sarah PM>Good. One important decision to log — we've officially decided to use scheduled Power Automate flows for consent field expiration instead of TTL. That approach is final and should be documented.

12
00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:10.000
<v Raghuram G.>Agreed. That was the right call. I'll add it to the architectural decisions log in the wiki.

13
00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:25.000
<v Sarah PM>Alright. Quick summary — Raghuram is on PR and documentation, Sneha needs the client sign-off unblocked, Arjun is finishing the tax UI pending Raghuram's review, Priya is on track. Same time next week. Thanks everyone.
